      <title>Οι χαμηλότερες ταχύτητες δεν σημαίνουν απαραίτητα λιγότερο σοβαρούς τραυματισμούς</title>
      <link>https://www.europolitis.eu/2026/02/21/%ce%bf%ce%b9-%cf%87%ce%b1%ce%bc%ce%b7%ce%bb%cf%8c%cf%84%ce%b5%cf%81%ce%b5%cf%82-%cf%84%ce%b1%cf%87%cf%8d%cf%84%ce%b7%cf%84%ce%b5%cf%82-%ce%b4%ce%b5%ce%bd-%cf%83%ce%b7%ce%bc%ce%b1%ce%af%ce%bd%ce%bf/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=%25ce%25bf%25ce%25b9-%25cf%2587%25ce%25b1%25ce%25bc%25ce%25b7%25ce%25bb%25cf%258c%25cf%2584%25ce%25b5%25cf%2581%25ce%25b5%25cf%2582-%25cf%2584%25ce%25b1%25cf%2587%25cf%258d%25cf%2584%25ce%25b7%25cf%2584%25ce%25b5%25cf%2582-%25ce%25b4%25ce%25b5%25ce%25bd-%25cf%2583%25ce%25b7%25ce%25bc%25ce%25b1%25ce%25af%25ce%25bd%25ce%25bf</link>
